      "source": "The implementation looks for links in CSS <code>@import</code> statements and\nalso inside CSS <code>url()</code> functions. All links are then passed through the\n<a href=\"ResourceResolverChain.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.resource\"><code>ResourceResolverChain</code></a> and resolved relative to the location of the\ncontaining CSS file. If successfully resolved, the link is modified, otherwise\nthe original link is preserved.",
      "translation": "实现会查找 CSS `<code>@import</code>` 语句中的链接以及 CSS `<code>url()</code>` 函数内部的链接。所有链接随后都会通过 <a href=\"ResourceResolverChain.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.resource\"><code>ResourceResolverChain</code></a> 进行处理，并相对于包含的 CSS 文件的位置进行解析。如果解析成功，则修改该链接；否则保留原始链接。",
      "count": 2
